{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos, fun, and competition: welcome to the world of <strong>Bubblizion</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/d2cb29ad32d5203b8d988b116a50a355.poster.avif?t=1751644679\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/d2cb29ad32d5203b8d988b116a50a355.webm?t=1751644679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/d2cb29ad32d5203b8d988b116a50a355.mp4?t=1751644679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Bubblizion</strong> is a <strong>mind-blowing and competitive party game</strong> for <strong>2 to 4 local multiplayer</strong>. The game is set in circular and dangerous arenas, where you will control the bouncing bubble in order to survive <strong>unexpected minigames</strong>, bumping rivals and dodging traps, all in intense, funny, and fast matches.<br><br><strong>PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS AND TURN THE COUCH POTATO MODE ON.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/64b5e061cc229221fa3e052654d6d4d9.poster.avif?t=1751644679\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/64b5e061cc229221fa3e052654d6d4d9.webm?t=1751644679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/64b5e061cc229221fa3e052654d6d4d9.mp4?t=1751644679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><strong>Bubblizion</strong> is perfect for multiplayer local mode. Just grab a controller and jump into the party. No long tutorials, just quick reflexes and much fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNPREDICTABLE MINIGAMES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/71ab4fd643f6adcca0ff7e8a1b843563.poster.avif?t=1751644679\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/71ab4fd643f6adcca0ff7e8a1b843563.webm?t=1751644679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/extras/71ab4fd643f6adcca0ff7e8a1b843563.mp4?t=1751644679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The<strong> chaos changes with each round</strong>. One moment, you're jumping calmly. The next, dodging <strong>explosive mines, collapsing walls or holes opening up in the ground</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has <strong>simple rules</strong>, but requires <strong>fast reactions and total focus</strong> to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce, push, survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubblizion</strong> is about <strong>laughter, surprises and healthy rivalry</strong>. Bounce, push, survive and try not to be the first bubble to burst.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757630?t=1751644679","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/b2658c40a648f47c964ed084c8bc5f11f5bae79b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751644679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/a13c05894f22840bbabdd18b6ac2ff19eb9bbbef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751644679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757630/a13c05894f22840bbabdd18b6ac2ff19eb9bbbef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751644679","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"d